    or commercial aircraft performance. Full-episode continuous trajectories, isolated
    burst captures, no impact or interception.\"\n  },\n  \"notes\": [\n    \"Every
    enabled appearance is planned once, not necessarily visible in every frame.\",\n   
    \"Airliner cruise is around 810-870 km/h at 9.5-11.5 km, not 1000 km/h at low
    altitude.\",\n    \"Agents negotiate complete routes before launch: straight
    traffic and bounded smooth-position drone flybys. Unexpected runtime deviation
    stops the owned run; no teleport or reactive navigation is applied.\",\n    \"No
    LLM, external API or extra ROS client is used by the planning network.\"\n  ]\n}\n"
